  "scope": "Both normal UNIT TC VECAGREE prologue and UNIT+1 numerical phases; complete NORMUNIT/NORMUNX1 callers through actual DANZIG. Ordinary canonical inputs/vector MODE-1 and initialized five VAC bases. UNIT phases retain canonical ownership; no added scheduling checks. All input cases compared through original full caller prefix at each of three subroutine phases. Generic unsupported caller modes/invalidVAC outside contract. No complete INTERPRETER file or resident application certified; RTB closure still requires IMUPULSE/hardware body and CMQUALITY groups."
